      "example_text": "Input: nums1 = [1,2], nums2 = [2,3]\nOutput: 2\nExplanation: Rearrange nums2 so that it becomes [3,2].\nThe XOR sum is (1 XOR 3) + (2 XOR 2) = 2 + 0 = 2.",
      "images": []
    },
